---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 pt-16 pb-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2">
        <a class="flex items-center gap-2 group mb-6" href="/">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-[#0F172A] border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-sm transition-transform duration-200 group-active:scale-90">
            V
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0F172A]">ValueLoop</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-sm mb-6">
          Platform untuk menghidupkan core value perusahaan melalui tantangan harian, leaderboard, dan insight.
        </p>
        <!-- Social media links hidden per user request -->
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Produk</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/#features" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Fitur</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#how-it-works" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Cara Kerja</a></li>
          <li><a href="/login" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Masuk</a></li>
          <li><a href="/signup" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Daftar</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Sumber Daya</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Blog & Artikel</a></li>
          <li><a href="/panduan" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Panduan Budaya Kerja</a></li>
          <li><a href="/studi-kasus" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Studi Kasus</a></li>
          <li><a href="/bantuan" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors">Bantuan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        &copy; {currentYear} ValueLoop. Hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-6 text-sm">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
